    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll (13)</strong>. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to open a temporary rift in reality and teleport through it to a point up to Far range.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, the rift will violently collapse after you step through. All creatures within Very Close range of your original position take <strong>d8+3</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency and are temporarily <em>Vulnerable</em>.</p>",
